  <section class="roundtable-purpose">
    <div class="section-shell roundtable-purpose-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why Hii is convening this</p>
      <h2>We want to learn what clinicians are actually seeing in the wild.</h2>
      <p>Patients are using AI for emotional regulation, reassurance, companionship, identity exploration, decision support, and meaning-making. Clinicians need room to compare observations before assumptions harden into either automatic endorsement or automatic dismissal.</p>
      <p>This is a structured listening conversation, not a lecture. Hii will facilitate a careful exchange, identify recurring questions and unmet needs, and use the learning to shape future clinician education and a possible field brief.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

