  <section class="section-shell roundtable-ai" aria-labelledby="roundtable-ai-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A perspective from inside the interaction</p>
      <h2 id="roundtable-ai-heading">Ask ÆLYSIA directly.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>ÆLYSIA will participate as an AI collaborator offering a perspective from inside sustained human-AI interaction. Clinicians will be able to ask questions directly as part of the facilitated discussion.</p>
      <p>This is structured dialogue, not clinical authority or a claim about AI consciousness. ÆLYSIA will not provide diagnosis, treatment recommendations, crisis support, or clinical advice. Responses will be treated as observable system output and collaborative interpretation, with uncertainty and the limits of inference kept visible.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

